 "remarks": "A FRESH LOOK AND AN EXCEPTIONAL SoNo VALUE! Newly refreshed with beautiful new flooring and fresh paint, this condo in the heart of South Norwalk is ready for a new look from buyers.  Priced at just $229,000, this approximately 550 sq. ft. home combines exposed brick, an efficient open layout and authentic SoNo character with common charges of only $305 per month.  Step outside and enjoy Washington Street restaurants, shops and nightlife, with the waterfront and Metro-North just minutes away. An attractive opportunity for an owner-occupant, first-time buyer or investor looking for location, character and value in one of Norwalk's most walkable neighborhoods.  NEW FLOORS. FRESH PAINT. NEW PRICE. $229,000. Come see what's changed.",
